      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GYM JUNKY (3) resumes after great success last prep, winning on three occasions and culminating in success over 1800m at Globe Derby Park on January 28. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Well-placed to pick up where he left off when last in work. CONSORT NZ (7) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 6 metres from the winner in fourth over 1609m at this track. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Meets a similar line up and he can take this out. CENT FOR PLEASURE (4) last appeared when she won by 8 metres over 1720m at Penrith three months ago. Should be thereabouts. DUTTON (5) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth over 1609m at this track last time out. Include in exotic bets.",
